    "description": "<p>Essentially a backpack full of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival_Gear\" title=\"Survival Gear\">Survival Gear</a>, the typical Field Kit contains two condensing canteens with built-in water purification systems, a sunshield roll, a week's worth of <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Ration_Pack\" title=\"Ration Pack\">Ration Packs</a>, two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Glow_Rod\" title=\"Glow Rod\">Glow Rods</a>, two <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Breath_Mask\" title=\"Breath Mask\">Breath Masks</a>, 24 Filters, 12 Atmosphere Canisters, and an <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/All-Temperature_Cloak\" title=\"All-Temperature Cloak\">All-Temperature Cloak</a>. </p><p>You need a Field Kit to make <a href=\"https://swse.fandom.com/wiki/Survival\" title=\"Survival\">Survival</a> checks to endure extreme temperatures. </p>",
